  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fNz5/73",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">안녕하세요! 오늘은 센서로 중화반응 실험을 해보았습니다ㅎㅎ<br><br>미리 비커에 수산화 나트륨 수용액과<br>페놀프탈레인 용액을 넣고,<br>염산을 점적 피펫을 넣어두었습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5140776975058c8fbf6e8d29b7196f037efbae81\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5140776975058c8fbf6e8d29b7196f037efbae81\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">거기에 pH센서와 수온센서를 꽂고</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aea9cdc0a05c3ca7bfad356cd8d24ab0ad3116be\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/aea9cdc0a05c3ca7bfad356cd8d24ab0ad3116be\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">묽은 염산을 한방울씩 떨어지도록 피펫을 열어두었습니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/167d13aded1de3b613bd4625920ed818c13677b9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/167d13aded1de3b613bd4625920ed818c13677b9\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">실험 영상은 다음과 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvz99kjp6j1exmfp63dmxxyf5@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1440\" data-video-height=\"1440\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvz99kjp6j1exmfp63dmxxyf5/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33333252928&amp;signature=ZFlJ5kUFhm4DfMOgtoC%2BbZU0008%3D&amp;ts=1776344128\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1440\" data-video-origin-height=\"1440\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvz99kjp6j1exmfp63dmxxyf5?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ejk5a2pwNmoxZXhtZnA2M2RteHh5ZjUiLCJ0aWQiOiIyNTQyY2Q0NS1lNWQ3LTQxMzItOTViNC0yNGNlZjMwZDcwMzMiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc5OTF9.--64zK5gW27euFqiL-t8BZ1Cp8JDYxCtgAzAnrNFV3eu-tIkbCvM9jekQp6QGrKht5UPX9NGcG_n9KoktaZNeQ&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1440\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">결과를 보면 염기성인 수산화나트륨이 있는 상태에서<br>산성인 염산을 떨어뜨리니, pH농도이 낮아지고<br>그 과정에서 열의 형태로 방출되는 에너지가<br>수온 센서에 반영되는 것 같습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42c252a08d6933f608bfa2136b8fe65511e0b319\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42c252a08d6933f608bfa2136b8fe65511e0b319\" data-origin-width=\"636\" data-origin-height=\"455\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">비록 PH센서가 7로 가는건 염산이 다 떨어져서 못봤지만... 그래도 이 정도 결과만으로도 어느정도 만족합니다!!ㅎㅎ<br>(화학실험.. 어렵네요.. pH센서 쓰는건 더 어렵고요)<br><br>(++)<br>와 지금보니까 이전 실험 망했다고 생각했는데</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8d7951c4b98767605f5fd0a110f57d536dc2696\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8d7951c4b98767605f5fd0a110f57d536dc2696\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">갑자기 염산 넣다가, 페놀프탈레인 색깔 없어지면서 pH가 팍 내려가는거보고<br>이상하다..? 싶어서, 실험 망했다 생각만 했는데</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f41344753ace457dae3315148348ac73c4d8451\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f41344753ace457dae3315148348ac73c4d8451\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2340\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a6ea1813555c810f83e34530addce40194a9131\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a6ea1813555c810f83e34530addce40194a9131\" data-origin-width=\"1020\" data-origin-height=\"1180\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">중화적정 그래프 찾아보니 진짜 이렇네요?</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6607f47b31678dff4258ae011c26e673143e3adb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6607f47b31678dff4258ae011c26e673143e3adb\" data-origin-width=\"876\" data-origin-height=\"1129\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이게 뭔가 싶네..<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5ea956575495e0f4f14ec1d090ba5c35447e01a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5ea956575495e0f4f14ec1d090ba5c35447e01a\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2340\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아 로그스케일이여서!!!! 이게 맞네!!<br><br>(++)오늘 다시 해보니 중화점이 좀 보이는 것 같습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c889921f487d67b08703b93002e9bdd4d2202ef4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c889921f487d67b08703b93002e9bdd4d2202ef4\" data-origin-width=\"961\" data-origin-height=\"1078\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ce86d7d5dc3e3774eaeb4c5cfb74c56ffab0588\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3ce86d7d5dc3e3774eaeb4c5cfb74c56ffab0588\" data-origin-width=\"961\" data-origin-height=\"1078\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AYXXM/dJMb9kmeoPe/eEYSy3RdDcTkBgIXuMQqb0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AYXXM/dJMb9kmeoPe/eEYSy3RdDcTkBgIXuMQqb0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그</p><p class=\"og-desc\">영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다</p><p class=\"og-host\">m.blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
